          "id": 1401,
          "uuid": "96ba2610-dd8b-490b-8583-5dc7ef871c02",
          "name": "Plancha de antebrazo",
          "exercise": 458,
          "description": "<p>Posición de salida:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Empiece a cuatro patas.Los brazos deben estar doblados en ángulo recto, con los hombros justo sobre los codos.La espalda debe estar recta, todo el cuerpo en línea recta.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Pasos:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Mantenga esta posición.</li>\n</ol>\n",
          "created": "2023-08-06T10:17:17.349574+02:00",
          "language": 4,
          "license": 1,
          "license_author": "YYCfit / BFad07"
        },
        {
          "id": 417,
          "uuid": "257cdb33-ba8b-410a-9396-5132b08dc912",
          "name": "Plank",
          "exercise": 458,
          "description": "<p>Mit dem Bauch auf den Boden legen und den Körper mit Unterarmen und Zehen abstützen. Beine, Rücken und Kopf sollten eine gerade Linie bilden.</p>\n",
          "created": "2023-08-06T10:17:17.349574+02:00",
          "language": 1,
          "license": 1,
          "license_author": "YYCfit / BFad07"
        },
        {
          "id": 238,
          "uuid": "7729ffe5-a896-4deb-80e0-f4e6163c0c09",
          "name": "Plank",
          "exercise": 458,
          "description": "<p>Get into a position on the floor supporting your weight on your forearms and toes. Arms are bent and directly below the shoulder.</p>\n<p>Keep your body straight at all times and hold this position as long as possible. To increase difficulty an arm or leg can be raised while performing this exercise.</p>\n",
          "created": "2023-08-06T10:17:17.349574+02:00",
          "language": 2,
          "license": 1,
          "license_author": "YYCfit / BFad07"
        }
